Package: vanill-ia-os
Version: 1.7.0
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Vanill-IA Project <contact@vanill-ia.com>
Homepage: https://vanill-ia.com
Depends: php-fpm, php-cli, php-sqlite3, php-curl, php-mbstring, php-xml, php-zip, sqlite3, cron, sudo, curl, procps, iproute2, util-linux, smartmontools, lm-sensors, ufw
Recommends: caddy, fail2ban, samba, zip, unzip, acl, chromium | chromium-browser, tigervnc-standalone-server | tightvncserver, novnc, websockify | python3-websockify, openbox
Suggests: cifs-utils, docker-ce | docker.io, docker-compose-plugin | docker-compose-v2 | docker-compose
Description: Vanill-IA OS - Self-Hosted WebOS & Native AI Server Platform
 Lightweight, zero-bloat, open-source WebOS designed to administer Debian,
 Ubuntu, and Raspberry Pi OS servers, optional Docker Compose stacks, Caddy
 reverse proxy routes, scheduled Cron tasks, file shares, isolated remote
 browsing, and native SysAdmin AI (Ollama and BYOK LLMs) as a PWA.
